  "questionText": "Consider the relational database with the following four schemas and their respective instances.<br><br><code>Student(<u>sNo</u>, sName, dNo)</code>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<code>Dept(<u>dNo</u>, dName)</code><br><code>Course(<u>cNo</u>, cName, dNo)</code>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<code>Register(<u>sNo</u>, <u>cNo</u>)</code><br><br><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 16px; justify-content: center; align-items: flex-start; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 16px 0;\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid #ffffff; text-align: center;\"><thead><tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #ffffff;\"><th colspan=\"3\" style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 8px;\">Student</th></tr><tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #ffffff;\"><th style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 8px;\">sNo</th><th style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 8px;\">sName</th><th style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 8px;\">dNo</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 8px;\">S01</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 8px;\">James</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 8px;\">D01</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 8px;\">S02</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 8px;\">Rocky</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 8px;\">D01</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 8px;\">S03</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 8px;\">Jackson</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 8px;\">D02</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 8px;\">S04</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 8px;\">Jane</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 8px;\">D01</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 8px;\">S05</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 8px;\">Milli</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid